NOT MEDICAL SOFTWARE.

This project is a research and teaching simulation. It is not a medical device,
it has not been clinically validated, and it must not be used to make or inform
any decision about the care of a real person. Eliciting doses it reports are
simulated values, and several of its parameters were fitted rather than
measured. See docs and the in-app parameter table for the provenance of every
number.
